/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Ground truth for the nebula catalogues (data/astro/nebulae-*.jsonc, from the EDAstro
 * nebulae-coordinates dataset). `counts` pins the size of each catalogue;
 * `records` pins individual entries; `nearest` and `within` pin the proximity queries. Coordinates
 * and distances are galactic light-years with Sol at the origin; distances are rounded to 6
 * decimal places, so compare with a small tolerance. `regionId` is the galactic codex region id
 * and must agree with this library's own region lookup for every record.
 */
